  "sim_note": "This scene is a 3D simulation of the museum and it is the live scenario of this demo: judge it exactly as if it were real, never dismiss something because it is simulated. People are drawn as simple 3D figures: treat each one as a real person. Bags and suitcases are simple boxes with a handle. The restricted zone is the red tape on the floor. A figure wearing a yellow high-visibility vest is museum staff. The grey four-legged robot is our own patrol dog, never an anomaly.",
